### First pull (omit since): everything you can see, tombstones included
GET {{host}}/sync
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delta pull: use serverTime from the previous response
GET {{host}}/sync?since=2026-10-15T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Push pending rows. accepted/rejected come back per row; rejected rows carry an ErrorCode
POST {{host}}/sync
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "changes": {
    "trips": [
      {
        "id": "{{tripId}}", "ownerId": "paste your user id", "title": "Bali 4 hari", "destination": "Bali",
        "startDate": "2026-11-20", "endDate": "2026-11-23", "baseCurrency": "IDR",
        "createdAt": "2026-10-15T01:00:00Z", "updatedAt": "2026-10-15T01:00:00Z"
      }
    ]
  }
}
